          "grounded_claims": 3,
          "claims": [
            {
              "statement": "使用 Azure 门户创建 VPN 网关时，需先创建虚拟网络和名为 GatewaySubnet 的网关子网。",
              "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/vpn-gateway/tutorial-create-gateway-portal",
              "source_id": "s-8f12da3279d55774",
              "segment_id": "p-ab308ecaf8608def",
              "span_id": "q-fba5463614d9726e",
              "invocationId": "e10dae80-63ce-43a0-a228-910a8137a2ca",
              "quote": "Virtual network gateway resources are deployed to a specific subnet named **GatewaySubnet**. The gateway subnet is part of the virtual network IP address range that you specify when you configure your virtual network."
            },
            {
              "statement": "支持下载 VPN 设备配置脚本以简化本地 VPN 设备的配置，该脚本预填充了 Azure VPN 网关、虚拟网络和连接的相关值。",
              "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/vpn-gateway/vpn-gateway-download-vpndevicescript",
              "source_id": "s-32634938295185d7",
              "segment_id": "p-8306f42f8eb486f1",
              "span_id": "q-ac96dbf3a656c84e",
              "invocationId": "6982805d-4b4e-4b2f-a215-6601967fe66b",
              "quote": "You can complete steps 1 through 3 in the workflow using the Azure [portal](https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/vpn-gateway/tutorial-site-to-site-portal), [PowerShell](https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/vpn-gateway/vpn-gateway-create-site-to-site-rm-powershell), or [CLI](https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/vpn-gateway/vpn-gateway-howto-site-to-site-resource-manager-cli). Step 4 involves configuring the on-premises VPN devices outside of Azure. The steps in this article help you download a configuration script for your VPN device with the corresponding values of your Azure VPN gateway, virtual network, on-premises network address prefixes, and VPN connection properties already filled in. You can use the script as a starting point, or apply the script directly to your on-premises VPN devices via the configuration console."
            },
            {
              "statement": "配置 VNet 到 VNet VPN 连接时，需选择适当的 SKU 并可选择启用活动-活动模式以支持多个网关 VM 实例。",
