              "span_id": "q-2a53e39bfc681b06",
              "invocationId": "6982805d-4b4e-4b2f-a215-6601967fe66b",
              "quote": "15.8. **Second public IP address:** Select **Create new**. This is available only if you selected **Enabled** for the **Enable active-active mode** setting."
            }
          ]
